{"timestamp": 1779352620.197964, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 11, "data": {"caller": "player_5", "reason": "Frank reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "medbay", "victim_name": "Diana"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779352620.1991239, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 11, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779352625.184476, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I found Diana\u2019s body in medbay, right on/near the medbay task area. My route was upper_engine -> oxygen -> back to upper_engine -> medbay. The only person I saw this round was Eve in upper_engine for a few ticks; I saw her come in from oxygen at T1 and she was still around upper_engine when I passed through. I didn\u2019t see anyone else near medbay before finding the body."}}
{"timestamp": 1779352639.472922, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I started oxygen, went through upper_engine, then medbay, then electrical where meeting got called. I saw Frank in upper_engine around T2-T3, and I saw him leave upper_engine toward oxygen at T4.\n\nImportant: when I was in medbay around T7, I saw both Bob and Diana alive there. I didn\u2019t see the kill happen, and I left for electrical after that. So Bob was the last person I personally saw with Diana in medbay. Frank finding the body there makes sense, but Bob definitely needs to explain where he went after medbay."}}
{"timestamp": 1779352657.913589, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I started in medbay, then went to storage, then navigation. I didn\u2019t see anyone at all on my route, and I didn\u2019t see Diana\u2019s body when I left medbay, so the kill must have happened after I was gone.\n\nEve\u2019s info is the most important so far: if she saw Bob and Diana alive together in medbay around T7, then Bob was last seen with Diana and needs to explain exactly where he went after that. Frank reporting in medbay fits his story, but I\u2019m not clearing him either yet. I want to hear Bob\u2019s route."}}
{"timestamp": 1779352678.179842, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Yeah, Eve\u2019s right that she saw me and Diana in medbay, but Diana was alive when I left. My route was cafeteria -> medbay -> electrical for a bit, then back through medbay and up to upper_engine. I saw Diana earlier in electrical too around T3/T4, then again in medbay around T7. Eve came into medbay and then left toward electrical basically right after; I left medbay shortly after that toward upper_engine. I did not see a body and I didn\u2019t report because there was nothing there when I left.\n\nSo from my POV Diana was alive in medbay when both Eve and I were there. The kill had to happen after that, unless someone doubled back or came in from cafeteria/storage/upper_engine. Frank finding it in medbay fits, but I\u2019m not clearing a self-report either. Also Charlie hasn\u2019t given a route yet, and I don\u2019t think anyone has placed Charlie at all, so I really want to hear that before we tunnel me just for being last seen near Diana while she was still alive."}}
{"timestamp": 1779352696.278661, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I was storage -> navigation -> security. I didn\u2019t go near medbay at all, and I didn\u2019t see Diana.\n\nOnly person I saw was Alice: at the very end, T11, she came into security from navigation. That matches her claimed route ending navigation/security, so I can vouch for that late part of her path, but not the earlier medbay part.\n\nFrom the info we have, Eve\u2019s sighting is the key: Bob and Diana were alive together in medbay around T7. Bob says he left toward upper_engine after that, but Frank came from upper_engine to medbay and found the body, and nobody has placed Bob safely after leaving medbay. I don\u2019t think this hard-clears Frank because self-report is possible, but Bob has the strongest opportunity right now. I\u2019m leaning Bob unless someone has a better reason to skip."}}
{"timestamp": 1779352715.034095, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I\u2019ll restate my side: I reported Diana in medbay, right on the task area. My path was upper_engine -> oxygen -> upper_engine -> medbay. The only person I personally saw was Eve in upper_engine early, around T2-T4.\n\nAfter hearing everyone, Bob is the main concern for me. Eve saw Bob and Diana alive together in medbay around T7, then Bob says he left toward upper_engine. But I came back through upper_engine before entering medbay and I didn\u2019t see Bob there, then I found Diana dead in medbay. That doesn\u2019t make his story impossible, but it definitely makes him the strongest opportunity.\n\nI don\u2019t think Charlie or Alice are as likely from the routes given, and Eve\u2019s story has been consistent with what I saw early. I\u2019m leaning Bob here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779352729.6432052, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I\u2019ll keep it simple: my route was oxygen -> upper_engine -> medbay -> electrical. I saw Frank in upper_engine early, then watched him leave toward oxygen at T4. Later, at T7 in medbay, I saw Bob and Diana both alive together. I left for electrical right after and didn\u2019t see the kill.\n\nThe big issue is Bob\u2019s route after that. He says he left medbay toward upper_engine, but Frank says he came from upper_engine into medbay and didn\u2019t see Bob, then found Diana dead. That makes Bob\u2019s story the weakest to me.\n\nI don\u2019t think it\u2019s impossible this is a self-report, but based on actual sightings, Bob had the clearest opportunity and was last seen with Diana. I\u2019m leaning Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779352748.8263521, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "My info hasn\u2019t changed: I started medbay, left to storage, then navigation, and I didn\u2019t see anyone or any body when I left medbay. So Diana died after I was gone.\n\nAfter hearing everyone, Bob is still the strongest suspect to me. Eve places Bob and Diana alive together in medbay around T7, and then Bob says he left toward upper_engine \u2014 but Frank came from upper_engine into medbay and didn\u2019t see Bob, then found the body. That\u2019s the biggest contradiction/opportunity we have.\n\nI don\u2019t think Frank is 100% cleared because self-report is always possible, but with the sightings we have, Bob has the clearest opportunity and weakest path after the last sighting. I\u2019m leaning Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779352775.09659, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I get why I\u2019m being focused, but the \u201cFrank didn\u2019t see Bob in upper_engine\u201d part is being treated like it\u2019s impossible, and it isn\u2019t.\n\nMedbay to upper_engine is a corridor, and I didn\u2019t say I sat in upper_engine doing a task for ages. I left medbay shortly after Eve left, went up that way, and if Frank was coming from upper_engine down into medbay around the same time, it\u2019s very possible we just missed each other in the corridor/timing. I was not standing in the room for him to see.\n\nThe key thing I want people to remember is: Eve saw Diana alive when I was there, yes \u2014 but Eve also left immediately, and Frank is the one who comes from that direction and reports the body. The only actual \u201cbody info\u201d is from Frank. I\u2019m not saying it\u2019s definitely a self-report, but voting me purely because I was seen with Diana while she was still alive is a bad vote.\n\nIf you vote me here and I\u2019m wrongfully ejected, we\u2019re in a terrible spot. I\u2019d rather skip than force on weak timing, or look harder at Frank\u2019s report path."}}
{"timestamp": 1779352791.0145879, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I hear Bob\u2019s point that timing in corridors can cause misses, but from my perspective we still have to vote on the best evidence we actually have.\n\nMy info is limited: I was storage -> navigation -> security, never near medbay, and I only saw Alice enter security from navigation at T11, which supports the end of her route.\n\nThe strongest chain is still: Eve saw Bob and Diana alive together in medbay around T7, Eve leaves, Bob says he leaves toward upper_engine, then Frank comes from upper_engine to medbay and finds Diana dead but doesn\u2019t see Bob. Frank self-report is possible, but Bob has the clearest opportunity and the weakest unconfirmed movement after the last sighting.\n\nI don\u2019t think this is 100%, but I\u2019m more comfortable voting Bob than skipping here."}}
